  "remarks": "Vladimir Tabak is the Director General of ANO “Dialog”, which is listed by the Union, and of ANO “Dialog of Regions”, pro-Kremlin organisations that are linked to Russian government influence operations, disinformation campaigns and that support Russian military information activities. ANO “Dialog” and its subsidiary ANO “Dialog of Regions” are funded by the Government of the Russian Federation.",
